## Show minus badge on members of expanded Studio groups

Context: On the Studio canvas, entities of an expanded group carried a plus
badge that collapses the group, which reads as the opposite action. Use a
minus on each member badge while the group is displayed; the group circle
keeps the plus to expand.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
   Member collapse badge glyph changed from + to a minus sign (U+2212) and
   tagged with the studio-group-toggle-collapse class.
2. tests/units/front/test_studio_views_groups_contract.py
   Assert the minus glyph and collapse class on member badges.

