## Flip Add to group flyout inside the Studio canvas

Context: Right-clicking near the right edge of the Studio canvas hid the
Add to group submenu behind the detail pane. The flyout only flipped against
window.innerWidth, but #ontology-map-container clips overflow and the right
pane is a sibling of the canvas.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
   Flip the submenu left when spaceRight inside the map container is too
   small; point the chevron the open direction.
2. tests/units/front/test_map_context_menu_tabs.py
   Contract that flip uses the map container clip box.

